<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $203,000 Copenhagen Open ATP tournament (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Played on Wednesday</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell (Spain) beat Eyal Erlich (Israel) 6-2  6-2</p>
<p>Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) beat Gerard Solves (France) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) beat 8-Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-2 6-7 (3-7) 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 4-6 6-4, 6-2. </p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Alexander Volkov (Russia) 4-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 6-1 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>1-Arnaud Boetsch (France) has withdrawn due to influenza.</p>
</text>
